<title>ROMANIA: Romanian retail sales fall 3.1 pct m/m in Sept.</title>
<headline>Romanian retail sales fall 3.1 pct m/m in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Board (CNS) reported the following economic indicator details:</p>
<p> ROMANIAN RETAIL SALES	SEPT    AUGUST     SEPT 95</p>
<p> volume bln ROL	     1,996.5   2,006.3    1,395.2</p>
<p> pct change mth/mth	    -3.1	+4.2	 -5.0</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr		+1.0	+6.5	+19.8</p>
<p> private sector pct share    77.4	77.9	 70.8</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE FIGURES (JAN TO MONTH)</p>
<p> volume bln ROL	    15,669.6  13,673.1   10,836.2</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	     +14.3     +16.3	+25.7</p>
<p> private sector pct share    79.0	79.2	 69.9</p>
<p>NOTES -- Year-on-year and month-per-month changes in comparable prices. -- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
